@ 15.1 - Proto-Eskimo-Aleut to Proto-Aleut
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Marsh, Gordon and Morris Swadesh (1951), “Kleinschmidt Centennial V: Eskimo Aleut Correspondences”, International Journal of American Linguistics, Vol. 17, No. 4 (Oct., 1951), pp. 209 – 216
